The product of 92 and 47 is calculated as follows:\n\nFirst, multiply 92 by 7:\n\\[\n92 \\times 7 = 644\n\\]\n\nNext, multiply 92 by 40 (since 4 in the tens place represents 40):\n\\[\n92 \\times 40 = 3,\\!680\n\\]\n\nAdd the two results together:\n\\[\n644 + 3,\\!680 = 4,\\!324\n\\]\n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{4324}",
