lculator, 50 * 84. Let me do that mentally. 50*80 is 4000, 50*4 is 200, so 4000+200 is 4200. Yep, definitely 4200. \n\nI don't see any errors in my calculations. So the product of 50 and 84 is 4200.\n"]
