 \n3. **Multiply the powers of 10:**  \n   \\(10 \\times 10 = 100\\).  \n4. **Combine the results:**  \n   \\(30 \\times 100 = 3000\\).  \n\nThus, the final answer is \\(\\boxed{3000}\\).",
