lation:**\n1. **Direct Multiplication:**  \n   \\( 14 \\times 50 \\).\n2. **Breakdown for Clarity:**  \n   - \\( 14 \\times 50 = 14 \\times (5 \\times 10) \\).  \n   - First multiply \\( 14 \\times 5 = 70 \\).  \n   - Then multiply by 10: \\( 70 \\times 10 = 700 \\).  \n\n**Final Answer:**  \n\\( \\boxed{700} \\)",
