So the product of 67 and 100 should be 6700. I think that's it. Maybe I can verify with a calculator if I have one, but since all manual methods confirm it, I'm pretty confident.\n"] 70%|██████▉   | 348/500 [6:04:41<2:03:44, 48.85s/it] 70%|██████▉   | 349/500 [6:05:24<1:58:26, 47.06s/it]
